    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Thomas Byrne Auctioneers are delighted to introduce to the market this beautiful mid-terraced property in Boyne Meadow, located just off the Old Slane Road on the western edge of Drogheda.\n\nThe bright and spacious accommodation comprises: Entrance Hall, WC, Sitting Room, Kitchen/Dining Room, 4 Bedrooms and Bathroom. The central heating is natural gas and the windows are double glazed PVC. 2 designated car parking spaces to front with garden to the rear.\n\nBoyne Meadows is situated in a quiet cul-de-sac just 2.5km from town centre. A range of local amenities such as Primary School, Church, shops, restaurants are all just a 15-minute walk. Access to the M1 Motorway is just a 3-minute drive. A fantastic property in a great location.\n\nACCOMMODATION\nEntrance Hall \n5.2m x 1.9mTiled floor.\n\n\nSitting Room \n5.2m x 3.3m\nTimber floor, Stove Fireplace, TV point.\n\nWC\nTiled floor.\n\nKitchen/Dining Room \n5.3m x 4.2m \nTiled floor, Fitted Kitchen, Patio to garden\n\nBedroom 1 \n4.0m x 3.2m \nBuilt in wardrobe, Carpet floor.\n\nBedroom 2 \n3.9m x 2.9m \nCarpet floor, built in wardrobe\n\nBedroom 3 \n3.9m x 2.2m\nCarpet floor.\n\nBedroom 4 \n3.3m x 1.9mTimber floor.\n\nBathroom \n2.1m x 1.7m\nTiled floor & splashback.\n"
      },
